bluejetty:00086128:ios.description:
Credit Europe Bank mobile app is your personal financial center, available 24/7.
Perform any transaction online: from everyday payments to currency exchange and opening new accounts — quickly, conveniently, and securely.
Instant access to key data — on your smartphone screen at any time:
• Current account and card balances in real time;
• Detailed transaction history with convenient filtering by category;
• Updated financial analytics: charts and reports to help you manage your budget;
• Current exchange rates;
• Geolocation of nearby branches and ATMs.
Simple and secure authorization — in just a few steps:
• Install the mobile app.
• Log in with your username and password — intuitive prompts will guide you through the process.
• Use a single account for the mobile app and online banking.
• Forgot your username or password? Recover them in the app in a minute — no need to call support.
Your mobile phone number must be registered in the Credit Europe Bank system.
App Features: Everything at Your Fingertips
1. Product Management – Complete Control of Your Finances
All your banking products in the palm of your hand:
• Open new accounts and reissue cards if necessary;
• Apply for a digital debit CARD PLUS in just a few minutes;
• Manage your deposits: open, top up, partially withdraw, or close them – without visiting the Bank;
• Track your loans: Get complete information on current and pre-approved offers, make full or partial repayments;
• Apply for a credit card installment plan online in just a few minutes: great offers and terms are available in the Mobile App;
• Request account statements, debt statements, and other documentation – instantly, electronically.
2. Payments and transfers — fast, convenient, and commission-free
Conduct any financial transactions in just a few taps:
• Interbank transfers using your details — commission-free;
• Instant transfers by phone number via the Faster Payment System (FPS/ “СБП”);
• Purchases using the FPS QR code;
• Pay for services in rubles: mobile phone, internet, utilities, taxes, and much more (including QR codes) — no hidden fees;
• Currency conversion at a favorable rate.
3. Loyalty program — earn money by paying for purchases with Credit Europe Bank cards
Get the most out of your purchases:
• Track your accumulated cashback and bonus points in real time — with details on each transaction;
• Pay for purchases with bonuses or receive cashback in rubles;
• Explore the catalog of bonus program partners — choose stores and services with increased cashback.
About the App:
A mobile app from Credit Europe Bank (Russia) JSC for managing your finances.
The app is certified and meets strict security requirements.
If you have any questions about the app, please email: customer_care@crediteurope.ru or use the feedback form on the website www.crediteurope.ru or in Online Banking.
Credit Europe Bank (Russia) JSC. Universal License No. 3311 of the Bank of Russia dated September 3, 2019, valid indefinitely.

